<title>HONG KONG: Italy to launch $1 bln Eurobond in early London.</title>
<headline>Italy to launch $1 bln Eurobond in early London.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Republic of Italy has mandated Morgan Stanley and SBC Warburg to lead manage a US$1 billion five-year benchmark Eurodollar transaction, SBC Warburg said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The issue will be formally launched at the London open today, SBC Warburg said. The bond is expected to price in the &quot;low twenties&quot; (basis points) over comparable U.S. Treasuries.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong News Room (852) 2843 6371</p>
</text>
